    content: "# Dashboard cards by role\n\n- **Application cards** (Community, Test Center, Knowledge Center…): everyone.\n- **Test Center card:** staff and above see a **gear** that opens management; members see an **arrow** that opens the learner view.\n- **Knowledge Center card:** staff and above see a **gear** that opens article management; members see an **arrow** that opens the reader.\n- **Administration card:** managers, admins and owners.\n- **Organization Setup and Configuration:** admins and owners only (managers do not see them at all).\n- **Contract & Billing, Support Tickets, Dashboard Banners:** managers and above.\n- **Mailbox:** once the organization's mailbox is set up, a **Mailbox** card appears in the **Organization Management** section, next to Administration (never in Your Workspace). Managers and above see it, and so do staff assigned to a departmental mailbox; staff who cannot open Administration see only the Mailbox card in that section.\n- **Audit Log:** admins and owners.\n- **Approve requests, terminate the contract, transfer ownership:** owner only.\n\n# My Account card\n\nEveryone sees **Profile** and **Help & Support**. Managers and above open Help & Support for the organization; others open personal tickets.\n\n# Profile reminder\n\nAn amber **Complete your profile** banner shows until you add your first and last name.",
