    content: "# Invite someone\n\n1. Open **Administration** from the dashboard.\n2. In **Staff & Access Management**, choose **Invite member**.\n3. Enter the email address and pick a role. You can only choose roles **below your own**.\n4. Send. The person receives an email with a link to accept.\n\n# Change a role or deactivate someone\n\n1. In the members list, click the person's avatar to open their profile and confirm who they are.\n2. Use the **Role** menu to change their role, or **Deactivate** to remove access (Reactivate restores it).\n\n# The rules\n\n- You can only manage people whose role is **strictly below yours**, and only move them to roles below yours.\n- Nobody can change their own role or deactivate themselves.\n- Nobody can assign the **owner** role from the app; ownership transfers go through Zebron.\n- Admins and owners may edit their own name, email, title and phone, but not their role.\n\n> A role change applies straight away. If someone already had the page open, the old access can last up to one hour; for urgent removals, ask Zebron to disable the account.",
