    audience: ["admin", "support"],
    tags: ["moderation", "reports", "topics"],
    content: "# Where\n\n- **Organization community:** /partner/org/your-organization/community/moderation (managers, admins, owners).\n- **Public community:** **Admin → Community → Moderation** (/admin/community/moderation, platform administrators).\n\n# Work the queue\n\n1. Open **Reports**. Each shows the post and the reason given.\n2. **Hide** (reversible), **Remove** (deleted), or **Dismiss** the report.\n3. **Hidden posts** lists everything hidden; **Restore** brings a post back.\n\nYou can also hide or remove a post directly from its menu, and remove comments.\n\n# Topics\n\n- Organization topics: managers and above, from the community sidebar's topic management.\n- Public topics: platform administrators.\n- Organization communities show the public topics plus their own.\n\n# For Zebron administrators: older posts\n\nPosts created before organization communities existed must be prepared once with **Prepare older posts** on the public Moderation page. It is safe to run again. If older public posts disappear after a rules deploy, run it.",
